   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "UPSCALE A KEEPER\n\n1. Drag the generated PNG onto the canvas: this restores its prompt and settings.\n2. Drag the same PNG onto the Load Image node below (exact pixels, no regeneration).\n3. Click the 'Generate' group title, Ctrl+B (bypass it); click the 'Upscale' group title, Ctrl+B (enable it). Queue.\n\nupscale_by 2 = 2048 px. For A4 at 300 dpi use ~3.5 (3584 px). Each tile is re-diffused at low denoise with this workflow's own model and prompt, so it adds real detail. Output: output/upscaled/.\nsteps = steps actually run PER TILE (low denoise does not shorten them), so time ~ tiles x steps x s/step: keep steps low.\nOlder PNGs (made before this group existed) restore without it: use the upscale-refine-sdxl workflow instead."
   ]
  },
